=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (elementary-embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SatisfactionPreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8SatisfactionPreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8SatisfactionPreservingMap}_S(f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(f,M,N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model8\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8SatisfactionPreservingMap}_S(f,M,N)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(f,M,N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This name is an explicit alias for an elementary embedding, whose upstream definition quantifies only over well-formed formulas and correctly maps finite tuples by composition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on